nk\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_L\">\\(T_L\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\)</span> (implicant set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_L\">\\(Q_L\\)</span> 为下式构造的项真点集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 取一致文字集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_L\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid T_L(a)=1\\}\\quad(L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_L\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid T_L(a)=1\\}\\quad(L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\;(T_L\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\leftrightarrow Q_L\\subseteq T(f))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\;(T_L\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\leftrightarrow Q_L\\subseteq T(f))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>T